8 real symmetric anticommuting 16x16 gamma matrices: Clifford relations verified exactly
R + C = 2 [x=v][y=u] exactly.  rr(R), rc(R) = 8 64   rr(C), rc(C) = 64 8
=> feasible pair (p,q) = (rr(R), rc(C)) = (8, 8) at N = 8 (Hurwitz point); as PIECES (Def. 7): log2 rr + log2 rc = 9 of 12 bits (rho = 3/4)
